    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Samsoni kūdubbūla mita gwa nzengo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwise lūmò ū Samsoni ūja Gaza ūūkabona ko malahya nebe, ūngeniha ūlaala mu ng'wakwe būjikū pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba Gaza būwīīlwa gīkī, “Ū Samsoni al'ūmu.” Na lūūlū būlīpīndya ī lipandī lyenīlo, būweeja ū būjikū weenūbo ū bose bagūlang'hanile ū mita gwa nzengo gwenūyo. Batīngile a ha mita ū būjikū wenūbo, nguno biwīlaga, “Ūlū būlangalūke ū būjikū tūkūmūlaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Samsoni ūlaala kūshisha būjikū ha gatī dūhū; hūna ūbūūka ūgadima a malugalīlo ga ha mita gwa nzengo, hamò nī ng'hīngī ja kūgadiimīīla būbīlī wajo; ūjidubbūla ī ng'hīngī jenījo na a malugalīlo gaho. Ī shose ūshisesela ha mabega ashitwaalile kwigūlya ya lūgūlū lwaalī lwilolile na Holebu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Samsoni na Delila",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya yenīyo, ū Samsoni ūntogwa nkīma, lina lyakwe Delila; wikalaga kū sī ya ntubīlo, mu Soleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A basugi ba Bafilisiti būja a ha kaya ya nkīma ng'wenūyo būūkang'wīla, “Nembalembage gete ūmo ūmanīlile kūshisha akūwīle ī mbisīla ya nguzu jakwe ī ningī jenījo, nī nzīla īyo tūdūgije kwītūmamīla kūshisha tūntūūle mu makono gise tūtunge, tūng'heebe. Būlī ūmò wise akūkwinha feza ja būdito wa kilo ikūmi n'idatū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Delila ūng'wīla ū Samsoni, “Aliniwīlage ī mbisīla ya nguzu jaako nū mumo ūdūgije kūtūngīlwa kūshisha banhū būkūheeba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Samsoni ūshosha alīhaya, “Ūlū nūūtungwa na ngoye mpungatī ja nge mhya jitaalī kūūma, nakūgogoloha nabize gīt'ūmo balī a banhū a bangī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a basugi ba Bafilisiti būng'wenhela ū Delila ngoye mpungatī ja nge mhya, jitaalī kūūma; ūntūngīla jenījo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū chūmba sha mu gatī baalīko bagosha baalī baang'wibandīīla, na lūūlū ū Delila ūmiisha alīng'wīla, “Samsoni baakūsanga a Bafilisiti.” Ūjitīna ī nge jenījo, jūbiza gīt'ūmo lūgoye lūkatīnīkīlaga ūlū lwikuumya na moto. Na lūūlū ī mbisīla ya nguzu jakwe yikala ītamanīīkile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Delila kūgema kabīlī na kadatū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Delila ūng'wīla ū Samsoni gīkī, “Gashi nīyo wanilembaga dūhū! Wanenheleja kūmanika ū nene gīkī nalī nchilū wa bachilū; niwīīlage shi ūmo ūdūgije kūtungīlwa!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'wīla, “Ūlū nūūtungwa na ngoye mhya ījo jitaalī kūtūmamīlwa, nakūgogoloha nabize gīt'ūmo balī a banhū a bangī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Delila ūsola ngoye mhya ūntunga na jenījo, hūna ūmiisha alīng'wīla, “Samsoni baakūsanga a Bafilisiti;” alīyo ū kū chūmba sha mu gatī baalīko a bagosha abo baalī bang'wibandīīla. Ūjitīnagūla najo ī ngoye jenījo na makono gakwe gītī būlūba dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Delila ūng'wīla gīkī, “Gashi ūtaalī ūnilembagūla dūhū, na kūnigīmba nyachilū kūshisha haha! Bebe, ka niwīlage ūmo ūdūgije kūtungīlwa.” Ūshosha alīhaya, “Ūlū ūgashibanya a masūnzū mpugatī ayo galī kū ntwe gwane genaya, hūna ūgatunganīja ha mashine ja kūbeegeja myenda, nakūgogoloha nabize gīt'ūmo balī a banhū a bangī.” Na lūūlū ū Samsoni aho waalaala, ū Delila ūgashibanya a masūnzū ga kū ntwe gwakwe ayo mpungatī, hūna ūgabohya ū mu maamashine gaa kūbeegeja myenda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūlola ūgapaligīnja na līīchūūma gūdaama. Hūna witana hangī alīhaya, “Samsoni baakūsanga a Bafilisiti.” Ū Samsoni aho wamisha ū mu tūlo, ūlīpagūla ī līīchūūma īlo lyalī līdaamīgije, pye na a maamashine ga kūbeegeja myenda ūgadubbūla aho gaalī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūheewa kwa ng'wa Samsoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Delelila ūng'wīla, “Ūdūgije kinehe ū kūhaya gīkī ūnitogilwe alīyo ī ng'holò yako ītī hamò nū nene? Ū lwenūūlū lwashika lūkangala lwa kadatū lūūlū ūkūmanagūnigīmba nyachilū dūhū, ndūhū nū kūniwīla ū gwa ng'hana ī mbisīla ya nguzu jaako ī ningī jenīji īlī kinehe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo wikalaga akūnkoyaga na mihayo ya mbika yenīyo būlī lūshikū, kūshisha nose ū Samsoni ūnoga kanogele ka kūbūlaja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ūnkundūlīla pyī īyo yalī mu ng'holò yakwe. Ūhaya gīkī, “Lūgembe lose lose lūtīnaakuumya ntwe gwane nūūlū kamò, nguno nalī Nazili; nalī munhū ng'wela kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA kūfuma kūbyalwa kwane. Na lūūlū ūlū nūūmoogwa, nakūgogoloha nabize gīt'ūmo balī a banhū a bangī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Delila aho wabona gīkī wang'wīla pyī īyo yalī ū mu ng'holò yakwe, ūtūma mhola ū kū basugi ba Bafilisiti alīhaya, “Nzūgi lūūlū ū lūkangala ūlū, nguno waniwīlaga pyī īyo īlī mu ng'holò yakwe.” Na ng'hana a basugi ba Bafilisiti biza nī feza jabo mu nkono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Delila ūneeleesha leeleesha ū Samsoni kūshisha ūlaala ha mazwi gaakwe, hūna witana munhū kwiza kūgamooga a masūnzū ga kū ntwe gwakwe ayo mpungatī. Hanuma ya henaho wandya kūūnyebenganya, ūbona ī nguzu jakwe jang'wīngaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ūmbaamhula alīng'wīla hangī, “Samsoni baakūsanga a Bafilisiti.” Ūmisha ū kūfuma ū mu tūlo akwiwīlaga, “Naje hangī ī hanze nakigoloole gīt'ūmo nakīītīlaga na kale nataligūke.” Alīyo walī atadeebile gīkī ū SEEBA walī waneka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a Bafilisiti būndima, būgakobola a miso gakwe, būntwaala Gaza. Būntunga minyololo ya chūūma sha shaba būmponya mu jeela, būntūūla ha nīmo gwa kūyūūsha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī nzwīlī jakwe ījo jalī jaamoogwa jandya kūlīīha hangī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Samsoni kūmala shiilī, na kūcha kwakwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
